{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"손잡이를 꼭 잡고","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"aba2a40fe385dfa8d8fed4ed2ec31381917b1664d6ba41256c1d8fa56499b953","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"리유니온의 포위를 뚫고 무사히 이동하는데 성공한 로도스 아일랜드.\n그러나 너무 격렬하게 움직인 탓인지, 미샤의 몸에 이상 현상이 발현한다.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"…나한테 준다면서?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"네가 느려터졌으니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"여러분이 무사해서 정말 다행이에요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"가볼까요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"동쪽 건물에서 아래층으로 내려가죠. 리유니온들은 우리가 어디 있는지 모를 거예요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"…안전… 한 거겠지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"네… 지금은요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…낯빛이 좋지 않으시네요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"…조금… 머리가 어지러운 것뿐이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"괜…찮아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"용문에 온 지… 얼마나 되셨나요, 미샤 씨?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"일주일… 정도?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…일주일이요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"응… 도시에 무서운 사람이… 잔뜩 나타났는데… 그러고 나서…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 일이 일어났는지는 잘 모르겠지만, 다들 도망쳤지… 그래서 나도…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온… 리유니온이 체르노보그를 공격했어요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"난 몰랐어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"당신은… 옛날부터 계속 감염자였나요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"잘… 모르겠어…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"그런데 요즘 다리에… 이런 게 생겼더라고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"…나…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…미샤 씨? 미샤 씨?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"메딕! 의료부!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["미샤"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["텍사스"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["엑시아"]}]}
